<title>INDIA: Indian ad hoc t-bills at 30.8 bln rupees on Feb 14.</title>
<headline>Indian ad hoc t-bills at 30.8 bln rupees on Feb 14.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The net issue of ad hoc treasury bills on February 14, 1997 was 30.8 billion rupees over the March 31, 1996 level, the Reserve Bank of India said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The level of ad hocs was 41.45 billion rupees on February 7, 1997, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
